{
 "schema": "xma-decoder-plan/1",
 "what": "How the XMA decoder libraries are built from FFmpeg: the commands FFmpeg's own make runs for the configuration in configured/config.h, taken from its dry run. Made by a private authoring script; nothing here comes from the game. 'expect' holds the libraries' hashes on the first machine (the NDK for macOS); 'identity' holds what recognises them on a host whose NDK compiler names itself differently: their objects in order, each without the compiler's name section (tools/own_disc/elf_sections.py --archive).",
